WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
FluffBud combines a familiar plush companion, an accessory, and an app concept.

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
Pair the physical companion through a proposed accessory-to-app setup experience.

00:16.000 --> 00:24.000
Make it feel like your buddy. Explore visual style and voice settings.

00:24.000 --> 00:32.000
Four interviews informed this six-week solo project, from app design to preliminary hardware testing.
